   1  *==============================================================================================================
   2  *P57 GAMS MODEL
   3  *==============================================================================================================
   4  *Run options (gams base_model.gms --NAME=value):
   5  *  --COAL       Coalition solved: 1, 2, 3, 4, 12, 13, 14, 23, 24, 34, 123, 124, 134, 234 or 1234 (default 1234)
   6  *  --BTCMULT    Multiplier on the bitcoin (BTC) price (cr_kBTC, default 1)
   7  *  --DINDMULT   Multiplier on the minimum industrial demand D_ind (kDind, default 1)
   8  *  --BGMULT     Multiplier on the biogas feedstock cost FeedCost('BG') (kBG, default 1)
   9  *  --RG2, --RG3, --RG4  Weights of the EcO at the three inner MOO points (default 0.4, 0.5, 0.6)
  10  *  --OBJ        Objective minimised: MOO (EcO and EnO weighted over RG, the default), EcO (economic objective) or EnO (environmental objective)
  11  *  --START      Warm start: GDX of an earlier EcO solution of the same Coalition, its integers fixed (EcO and MOO runs)
  12  *  --SEED, --SEEDPLAYER  With --START: take the design of player 1, 2, 3 or 4 from another solution (GDX) instead
  13   
  24   
  25  *==============================================================================================================
  26  *PLAYERS AND COALITIONS
  27  *==============================================================================================================
  28  Sets
  29  player              Players                     /1 Supply chain network and CHP (SCN-CHP),
  30                                                  2 MEE,
  31                                                  3 HEN,
  32                                                  4 Crypto-mining Farm/
  33  coal                Coalitions                  /1, 2, 3, 4, 12, 13, 14, 23, 24, 34, 123, 124, 134, 234, 1234/
  34  mem(coal,player)    Players in each Coalition   /1.     1,
  35                                                  2.      2,
  36                                                  3.      3,
  37                                                  4.      4,
  38                                                  12.     (1,2),
  39                                                  13.     (1,3),
  40                                                  14.     (1,4),
  41                                                  23.     (2,3),
  42                                                  24.     (2,4),
  43                                                  34.     (3,4),
  44                                                  123.    (1,2,3),
  45                                                  124.    (1,2,4),
  46                                                  134.    (1,3,4),
  47                                                  234.    (2,3,4),
  48                                                  1234.   (1,2,3,4)/
  49  mbr(player)         Members of the Coalition solved
  50  act(coal)           Coalitions within the Coalition solved: their equations are in the model;
  51   
  52  Singleton Set solved(coal) Coalition solved (--COAL) /1234/;
  53   
  54  mbr(player) = sum(solved, mem(solved,player));
  55  act(coal)   = yes$(sum(player$(mem(coal,player) and not mbr(player)), 1) = 0);
