  72  Parameters
  73  OH              Plant operating hours [h per year]                                  /8160/
  74  HY              Calendar hours [h per year]                                         /8760/
  75  EcOunit         Unit of every EcO variable and of the objective [$ per year]        /1e5/
  76  FX              Mean European Central Bank rate from Oct 2025 to Sep 2026 [R per $] /16.5548/
